{"symbol":"KROWNIQ","yahoo":"KROWNIQ.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Krowniq Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","website":"https://www.lykis.com","about":"Krowniq Limited engages in the fast moving consumer goods (FMCG) business in India and internationally. The company offers rice, sugar, pulses, spices; and various personal care products, such as baby cream, baby shampoo, baby soap, baby mosquito repellent roll-on, body lotions, petroleum jelly, body oils, body scrubs, body wash, shower gel, peel off mask, face wash, face creams, hair colour cream, hair oil, toothpaste, toothbrush, soaps, and moisturizing lotions. It also provides biscuits and cookies, sunflower and palm oil, instant coffee, lollipops, jelly filled hard candy, canned food, peanut butter and chocolate spread, cereals, pastas and soups, sauces, seasonings, perfumes, deodorants, and roll ons; as well as raw materials, including Hard Paraffin Wax, Calcium Carbonate, Raw Talc, Extra Neutral Alcohol, PET resin, Caustic soda flakes, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Cetyl Alcohol, baking soda, margarine, and waxes and petroleum products. In addition, it sells pharma, industrial goods, and stationery products. It sells its products under the Lykis, H&H, Rox, Bonita, Monami, Special, Lykon, Bentol, Stylo, Bon Fami, Lyfresh, Calmon, Bon Dejeuner, Mellar, Bom Dia, Blue Fins, Bon Appetit, Senhorita, Polo Star, Leopard, Elephant, Carnoba, Classic, Maria, Spectra, Flite, Bahamas, Sparx, Metro, Cipro, Para, Dextrose and Water for Injection, Davigra, Dermogerme, A-DEM, Candicyl, Rectostop-HC, Nystatine, and Davimov brand names. The company was formerly known as Lykis Ltd and changed its name to Krowniq Limited in July 2026. Krowniq Limited was incorporated in 1984 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:55:52+00:00","quote":{"price":49.3,"prevClose":50.01,"marketCap":95.52,"high52":61.8,"low52":29.21,"pe":8.82,"bookValue":null,"div